        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>线性代数竞赛总结版</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] },\n      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; }\n    body {\n      background: #fff99a;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      color: #272727;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 1.38;\n    }\n    .red-left {\n      position: fixed;\n      left: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      width: 25px;\n      height: 50%;\n      background: #eb1648;\n    }\n    .red-bottom {\n      position: fixed;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      height: 24px;\n      background: #eb1648;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 490px;\n      height: 670px;\n      margin: 26px auto 24px;\n      padding: 5px 70px 16px;\n      background: #fff;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n    .section { margin: 0 0 3px; }\n    .indent { padding-left: 17px; }\n    .indent2 { padding-left: 33px; }\n    .formula {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      margin: 1px 0;\n    }\n    .tight { line-height: 1.22; }\n    .subhead { margin-top: 4px; }\n    .four {\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 7px;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    mjx-container { margin: 0 !important; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"red-left\"></div>\n  <div class=\"red-bottom\"></div>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>线性代数竞赛总结版</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">（2）基本结论</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">判断向量组线性相关(命题4.2, 命题4.3(2), 定理4.1及推论1, 定理4.2)</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">充分: $a_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_n$ 线性相关 $\\Leftrightarrow$ 其中至少有一个向量可由其余向量线性表示</div>\n    <div class=\"indent2\">某一个部分向量组线性相关</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">充分: $a_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_l$ 线性相关 $\\Leftrightarrow$ 向量的个数大于向量分量的个数</div>\n    <div class=\"indent2\">$a_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_l$ 为 $\\alpha$ 的非零的向量组线性表示</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section subhead\">判断向量组线性无关(命题4.3(3), 命题4.4 的推论)</div>\n    <div class=\"section\">2、等价向量组</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">(1) （Ⅰ）可由（Ⅱ）线性表示, 则 $r(Ⅰ)\\leq r(Ⅱ)$。</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">(2) （Ⅰ）与（Ⅱ）等价, 则 $r(Ⅰ)=r(Ⅱ)$。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">3、子空间的验证</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">(1) 非空, 加法与数乘乘法的封闭;</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">(2) 命题4.1(生成子空间)一例4、9, 例4、35</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">4、向量组的极大线性无关组(命题4.6, 定理4.4, 4及推论2)、(线性)子空间的基与维数</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">(1) 写成列向量作初等行变换, 确定向量组的秩与极大无关组。</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">(2) 对于 $W=L(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_l)$, 则 $\\dim W=r(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_l)$, 即生成子空间的维数</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">与其线性无关组 $a_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_l$ 的秩与极大无关组。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section subhead\">5、坐标的概念、基变换公式与坐标变换公式</div>\n    <div class=\"indent tight\">坐标: $\\gamma=x_1\\alpha_1+x_2\\alpha_2+\\cdots+x_n\\alpha_n$ 在基 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_n$ 下的坐标$[x_1,x_2,\\ldots,x_n]^T$。</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">基变换公式: $(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\ldots,\\beta_n)=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_n)S$</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">坐标变换公式:</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">\n      $(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\ldots,\\beta_n)=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_n)S$<br>\n      $\\gamma=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\ldots,\\alpha_n)X\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad X=SY\\ 或Y=S^{-1}X$<br>\n      $\\gamma=(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\ldots,\\beta_n)Y$\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"four\">四、线性方程组(含多量、不含多量)</div>\n    <div class=\"section\">1、解的情况</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">\n      (1)&nbsp;&nbsp; $AX=\\beta\\quad\n      \\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\n      r(A)\\ne r(\\bar A),\\ 无解\\\\\n      r(A)=r(\\bar A)=n,\\ 唯一解\\\\\n      r(A)=r(\\bar A)&lt;n,\\ 无穷多解\n      \\end{array}\\right.$\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">\n      若 $A$ 就是方阵, 则 $AX=\\beta\\Rightarrow\n      \\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\n      |A|\\ne0,\\ 唯一解\\\\\n      |A|=0\\Rightarrow r(A)=r(\\bar A),\\ 无穷多解\\\\\n      |A|=0,\\ r(A)\\ne r(\\bar A),\\ 无解\n      \\end{array}\\right.$\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">(2) 齐次线性方程组 $AX=0$ 有非零解 $\\Leftrightarrow r(A)&lt;n$。</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">若 $A$ 就是方阵, 则齐次线性方程组 $AX=0$ 有非零解 $\\Leftrightarrow |A|=0$。</div>\n    <div class=\"section\">2、解的结构</div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">——阿光爱分享——</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
